# Everything the image must never contain. Two of these are correctness issues, not
# just size: a baked sat_sa.duckdb would ship a stale database (it is rebuilt on
# startup), and a copied host venv would carry Windows binaries into a Linux image.
**/venv/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/node_modules/
frontend/dist/
frontend/tsconfig.tsbuildinfo
**/*.duckdb

.git/
.github/
.claude/
.agent/
.impeccable/
docs/
scripts/
*.md
!backend/*.md

.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
